/target/
/target-*/
/frontend/node_modules/
/frontend/dist/
/integrations/vscode-himind-ai/node_modules/
/integrations/vscode-himind-ai/out/
/integrations/vscode-himind-ai/dist/
/installer/generated/
/artifacts/
/releases/
/artifacts-github/
# 发布暂存目录按版本命名（artifacts-github-v0.3.67 等），发完就不再需要，
# 留在工作树里会把子模块判成脏，进而挡住父仓「工作区必须干净」的发布前置。
/artifacts-github-*/
/.env
/.env.*
!/.env.example
*.log
*.tmp
# 本地 e2e 截图、日志和临时验收产物，不作为源码提交。
.acceptance/
/artifacts-runtime-test*/
/artifacts-signed*/
/artifacts-codesigned*/
*.exe
*.pdb

# Local Agent state must never be committed.
/agent-state.json
/agent-state.device-id
/agent-preferences.json
/agent-remote-execution.json
/agent-remote-clients.json
/agent-user-authorization.json
/agent-user-authorization.lock
/agent-update-state.json
/agent-state.distribution.json

# Top-level release/workflow staging output
/dist/
/resources/runtime/*.zip
/resources/runtime/*.signature.json
